        "Description": "Good evening, 47. \r\rThe final dregs of The Harmonium&apos;s leadership has gathered at Viñedo Yates in Mendoza in a last ditch attempt to grasp onto a single shred of what they once had. With these four out of the picture, the entire organisation will finally collapse. \r\rMake this next meeting their last, and we will finally be rid of this parasite.\r\rEliminate the targets.\r\rGood luck.",
